
@startuml
title PayLink - Payment State Machine Diagram

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F5F7FA
    BorderColor #34495E
    FontColor #172B4D
    ArrowColor #34495E
    BorderThickness 1.5
}

[*] --> Initiated : Payment created

state "Initiated" as Initiated
state "FundsHeld" as FundsHeld
state "SentToBiller" as SentToBiller
state "Completed" as Completed
state "Failed" as Failed
state "Unknown" as Unknown
state "Rejected" as Rejected
state "Refunded" as Refunded

Initiated --> FundsHeld : T1: Checks pass and sufficient funds\n/ Hold amount + fee

Initiated --> Rejected : T2: Fraud check fails or\ninsufficient funds\n/ Record reason; no money moves

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : T3: Request sent to biller\n/ Send unique payment reference

SentToBiller --> Completed : T4: Biller confirms\n/ Finalize charge; record fee and commission

SentToBiller --> Failed : T5: Biller refuses\n/ Record reason and biller code

SentToBiller --> Unknown : T6: No answer within timeout\n/ Keep hold; schedule re-queries

Unknown --> Completed : T7: Biller later confirms\n/ Apply T4 effects

Unknown --> Failed : T8: Biller refuses later or\nreconciliation proves non-receipt

Failed --> Refunded : T9: Release held funds\n/ Return total to available

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Funds remain held.
  Automatic re-queries:
  1, 5 and 15 minutes.
  Maximum three attempts.
  No automatic refund.
  No answer keeps payment Unknown.
end note

note right of Failed
  Temporary state.
  T9 follows immediately
  in the same operation.
end note

note bottom of Completed
  Terminal payment state.
  No outgoing business transitions.
end note

note bottom of Rejected
  Terminal payment state.
  No outgoing business transitions.
end note

note bottom of Refunded
  Terminal payment state.
  No outgoing business transitions.
end note

@enduml
